===Verb===
{{en-verb|syndicat}}

# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To [[become]] a syndicate.
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To put under the [[control#Noun|control]] of a group acting as a [[unit]].
# {{lb|en|transitive|mass media}} To [[release]] media content through a syndicate to be [[broadcast#Verb|broadcast]] or [[publish]]ed through multiple outlets.

